sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant LLM as LLM (Claude)
    participant MCP as MCP Client
    participant Server as MCP Server (Validator)
    participant Solver as Solver Engine (angr)
    participant Binary as Target Binary

    Note over User, Binary: Phase 1: Hypothesis Generation
    User-->>LLM: Prompt + Path to Source (file/folder)
    LLM->>LLM: Read Code & Form Hypothesis<br/>(via Filesystem MCP / Native Tools)
    Note over LLM: Identify vuln. function & args

    Note over User, Binary: Phase 2: Validation Request
    LLM->>MCP: Tool Call: validate_vulnerability()
    MCP->>Server: Forward Request (Target, Args)
    Server->>Server: Parameter Type Check

    Note over User, Binary: Phase 3: Symbolic Execution
    Server->>Solver: Delegate Analysis
    Solver->>Binary: Simulate Execution (Symbolic State)
    Solver->>Solver: Check for Crash / Canary Hit

    Note over User, Binary: Phase 4: Evidence & Reporting
    Solver-->>Solver: Extract Input Hex
    Solver-->>Server: Result + Evidence
    Server-->>MCP: JSON Response
    MCP-->>LLM: Structured Evidence
    LLM->>LLM: Generate Report based on Evidence
    LLM-->>User: Final Security Report